# NUT shutdown verification target map
# Format:
# TARGET_NAME|IP_ADDRESS|TIMEOUT_SECONDS|NETWORK_DEPENDENCY_IP|WRAPPER_PATH|NOTES
#
# Result standard:
# PASS    = shutdown confirmed
# WARN    = command sent but not verified
# UNKNOWN = cannot verify due to network/switch path
# FAIL    = target still online after shutdown attempt
#
# Leave NETWORK_DEPENDENCY_IP empty if not needed.

